"bfy6dvy33xzj": {
"body": "Between 10:04 UTC and 20:00 UTC on August 21, applications in this dedicated cluster were\nunable to establish connections to other applications in the same dedicated cluster.\nApplications that depend on data provided by another application may have been unavailable to\nend users during this period.\n\nThe cause was identified in the platform network configuration and a fix has been applied.\nConnectivity between applications has been restored and confirmed. No action is required from\ncustomers, and it was not necessary to restart or redeploy applications. If you continue to\nexperience any problems, please contact Mendix Support.",
