},
"sp97dcvjykmp": {
"body": "Our cloud provider has restored capacity in the affected availability zone, and this incident is now resolved.\n\nThe issues with connecting to databases and deploying applications in the Mendix Cloud UK cluster have been cleared. Operations that were paused as a precaution, including first time deployments, downsizes, and database clears, can now be resumed safely.\n\nIf you continue to experience any problems, please contact Mendix Support.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your patience throughout the incident.",
